{"id":"vphrase","level":2,"levelName":"Ulpan Alef","n":16,"of":19,"title":"What people actually say","titleHe":"בִּטּוּיִים","goal":"The fixed phrases — greetings, wishes, and the small change of a conversation.","sections":[{"type":"text","body":"None of these is worth taking apart. בְּתֵאָבוֹן is not a sentence you build, it is a noise you make when food arrives, and every language has thirty of them. Learn them whole and use them on day one."}],"vocab":[{"he":"מַה שְּׁלוֹמְךָ","en":"how are you (m.)","translit":"ma shlomcha"},{"he":"מַה שְּׁלוֹמֵךְ","en":"how are you (f.)","translit":"ma shlomech"},{"he":"מַה נִּשְׁמָע","en":"what's new, how's it going","translit":"ma nishma"},{"he":"בְּסֵדֶר","en":"okay, fine","translit":"beseder"},{"he":"אֵין בְּעָיָה","en":"no problem","translit":"ein be'aya"},{"he":"נָעִים מְאֹד","en":"pleased to meet you","translit":"na'im me'od"},{"he":"נָעִים לְהַכִּיר","en":"nice to meet you","translit":"na'im lehakir"},{"he":"אֵיךְ קוֹרְאִים לְךָ","en":"what's your name (m.)","translit":"eich kor'im lecha"},{"he":"בְּהַצְלָחָה","en":"good luck","translit":"behatslacha"},{"he":"בְּתֵאָבוֹן","en":"enjoy your meal","translit":"bete'avon"},{"he":"לְחַיִּים","en":"cheers — to life","translit":"lechayim"},{"he":"מַזָּל טוֹב","en":"congratulations","translit":"mazal tov"},{"he":"כָּל הַכָּבוֹד","en":"well done","translit":"kol hakavod"},{"he":"תִּתְחַדֵּשׁ","en":"enjoy the new one","translit":"titchadesh"},{"he":"בָּרוּךְ הַבָּא","en":"welcome (to a man)","translit":"baruch haba"},{"he":"בְּרוּכָה הַבָּאָה","en":"welcome (to a woman)","translit":"brucha haba'a"},{"he":"שָׁנָה טוֹבָה","en":"happy new year","translit":"shana tova"},{"he":"חַג שָׂמֵחַ","en":"happy holiday","translit":"chag same'ach"},{"he":"שַׁבָּת שָׁלוֹם","en":"a peaceful Sabbath","translit":"shabat shalom"},{"he":"עֶרֶב טוֹב","en":"good evening","translit":"erev tov"},{"he":"לַיְלָה טוֹב","en":"good night","translit":"layla tov"},{"he":"מַה קָּרָה","en":"what happened, what's wrong","translit":"ma kara"},{"he":"לֹא נוֹרָא","en":"never mind, it's not so bad","translit":"lo nora"},{"he":"חֲבָל","en":"what a shame","translit":"chaval"},{"he":"כַּמּוּבָן","en":"of course","translit":"kamuvan"},{"he":"בֶּאֱמֶת","en":"really, truly","translit":"be'emet"},{"he":"תֵּכֶף","en":"in a moment","translit":"techef"},{"he":"דַּי","en":"enough, stop it","translit":"dai"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["is finished","seven (f.)","safe, certain","how are you (m.)"],"correct":3,"prompt":"מַה שְּׁלוֹמְךָ","translit":"ma shlomcha"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["what's your name (m.)","speaks","bus","how are you (f.)"],"correct":3,"prompt":"מַה שְּׁלוֹמֵךְ","translit":"ma shlomech"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["hundred","of blessed memory (ז״ל)","what's new, how's it going","flower"],"correct":2,"prompt":"מַה נִּשְׁמָע","translit":"ma nishma"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["cucumber","un-, without","forest","okay, fine"],"correct":3,"prompt":"בְּסֵדֶר","translit":"beseder"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["no problem","welcome (to a woman)","to her","real, true"],"correct":0,"prompt":"אֵין בְּעָיָה","translit":"ein be'aya"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["milk","matter, thing (Aramaic)","the book","pleased to meet you"],"correct":3,"prompt":"נָעִים מְאֹד","translit":"na'im me'od"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["place","obliged, must","nice to meet you","the internet"],"correct":2,"prompt":"נָעִים לְהַכִּיר","translit":"na'im lehakir"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["what's your name (m.)","horse","while, whereas","flame, blade"],"correct":0,"prompt":"אֵיךְ קוֹרְאִים לְךָ","translit":"eich kor'im lecha"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["me","knee","a comma","good luck"],"correct":3,"prompt":"בְּהַצְלָחָה","translit":"behatslacha"}